                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Obesity is a national health crisis affecting 95 million Americans. That\u2019s why I joined my colleagues in urging CMS to reinstate the proposed rule expanding access to life-saving, affordable anti-obesity medications for Medicare & Medicaid beneficiaries. \n\nWe must act now to lower costs and save lives.",
