                "text": "Protecting our health and safety must be the top priority. Using radioactive materials like phosphogypsum in our roads puts families and our future at risk.\n\u00a0\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m proud to join @RepMaxwellFrost to reintroduce the No Radioactive Roads Act, because every Floridian deserves safe, toxin-free communities.",
