                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Thanks to a letter led by @RepLoisFrankel and me, the administration is finally taking action to lower the cost of anti-obesity medications for Americans. \n\nThis is a strong first step, but more action is needed.\nhttps://t.co/7OuccI4n6L",
