                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "95% of malaria deaths occur in Africa, resulting in profound loss of life. This crisis poses a significant threat to global health and demands urgent attention.\n\nReducing funding is not only poor policy but also detrimental to global security.\n\nMy resolution aims to strengthen Africa\u2019s capacity to detect and respond to public health emergencies promptly.\n\nInvesting in Africa\u2019s health is an investment in the safety of the American people.",
